    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8711;</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>{</mo><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>}</mo></math>&nbsp;be such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#9651;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8711;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is a tautology</p><p>Now checking all options by making truth table we get,</p><p>Option <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8711;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8744;</mo></math></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t</tr>\t</t